{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1419682501381340/posts/28795559760033578/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1419682501381340/posts/28795559760033578/","title":"Anyone who still thinks the 2020 election wasn’t stolen is deluded. | Facebook","description":"Anyone who still thinks the 2020 election wasn’t stolen is deluded.\nPresident Trump was fraudulently impeached using fake/manipulated evidence. \n\nWhat about the letter signed by 51 former high-level...","language":"en","text":"### Anyone who still thinks the 2020 election wasn’t stolen is deluded.\n\nPresident Trump was fraudulently impeached using fake/manipulated evidence.\n\nWhat about the letter signed by 51 former high-level intelligence officers saying that the Hunter Biden laptop story had all the signs of Russian disinformation? They knew that was false when they wrote it. That is election interference. They did it just so Biden would have a (fraudulent) comeback during the presidential debate. Just the illegal suppression of the Hunter Biden laptop story alone by the Biden regime was enough to overturn the election.\n\nThe Democratic Party colluded with media/fake news to suppress positive stories and elevate false stories about President Trump. This is not conjecture. We have them on tape. We know that numerous important stories were suppressed in the fake news and that numerous fake stories were elevated in the fake news. ￼￼￼\n\nState legislatures moved too slowly to stop the deep state from illegally changing state voter laws benefiting the Democrats. That includes universally mailed ballots to everyone on voter registration rolls and the negation of voter identification requirements. ￼ (Democrats continue to block access to state voter registration rolls to verify eligibility.)￼\n\nDemocrats racially gerrymandered various states and have gotten away with it for decades. Gerrymandering gave the Democrats about a 15–20 seat advantage in the House of Representatives and about a 5-vote advantage in the electoral college. (Happily, this appears to be getting corrected this year.)￼\n\nPsychologist Robert Epstein documented that Google alone surreptitiously changed up to 15 million votes to the Democrats by manipulating online search results and sending out voter reminders selectively to Democrats. The Biden regime also illegally coerced social media and search engines to censor conservatives and alter search results to favor the Democrats.\n\nWe have repeated dropbox stuffing on tape.\n\nWe also have ballots where the paper did not meet specs showing they were not legitimate but were counted anyway.\n\nWe have rampant ballot harvesting which breaks the chain of custody required by law.\n\nWe have reports on tape of homeless people being paid to vote and their ballots harvested.\n\nWe have the the torpedoing of voter ID laws, the weakening of signature verification, and postmark laws. That means ballots are still being counted up to a month after election day. Suspiciously, those late ballots always favor the Democrats. Go figure. ￼￼\n\nThe 2020 vote tabulation wasn’t properly monitored in blue venues due to virus restrictions. GOP poll watchers were kept too far away to effectively monitor. Window were even covered to stop scrutiny.\n\nHow about the release of the virus by China? (I believe it was intentional.) Whether it escaped from a lab or was unleashed, China did not stop international flights from leaving Wuhan when it did stop domestic travel from Wuhan. I conclude China deliberately spread the virus to sabotage President Trump‘s reelection odds to rescue China’s struggling economy.\n\nThe Russia hoax was one big manipulation. Democrat leadership knew it was false all along. Hillary Clinton invented it, and Obama picked up her fumble and ran with it after she lost to Trump in collusion with corrupt fake news. That isn’t conjecture. We have the documentary evidence.\n\nOne of the biggest methods to interfere with elections has been the sabotage of immigration laws, allowing millions of people illegally into the United States. That is a blatant attempt to alter demographics in favor of the Democrats. Referred to as “replacement theory,” it shows a treasonous effort to usurp real Americans at the ballot box. Democrats also ensure that many were registered to vote so ballots would be sent to their addresses that could be stolen and then forged.\n\nNow, we can add lawfare to this list. The Democrats used malicious prosecutions to threaten, intimidate, and punish prominent Republicans and fundraisers including President Trump.\n\nThe IRS slow-rolled applications for conservative fundraisers. They selectively audited political opponents by targeting them. (See Lois Lerner.)\n\nIn President Trump‘s national speech on July 17, 2026, he announced that voter registrations were hacked by the Chinese (and the Iranians). Why do you think they did that? The Chinese also smuggled about 40,000 fake driver's licenses to Chinese citizens living in the USA. Why do you think it did that? In the same speech, President Trump revealed that the Venezuela elections were stolen with rigged voting machines that were used in the USA as well. He showed that electronic voting machines can be easily manipulated.\n\nJust in the last year, the Trump administration has uncovered hundreds of billions of dollars worth of fraud. That fraud has been funneling money to Democrat organizations that kick back to Democrat campaigns. The Democrats have been buying votes through these money laundering operations and funding their own campaigns and efforts illegally. ￼\n\nThe purpose of my post is not to undermine faith in our elections. It’s to inspire and educate on what needs to be done to make our elections secure. No republic can survive for long without universally recognized free and fair elections. ￼\n\nAll reactions:\n\n55\n\n11\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nShare\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nTom Drexler\n\nAmong the trump dump of election integrity documents released in tandem with the his speech the other day, he accidentally produced real evidence on one item. A National Intelligence Council assessment on “Foreign Threats to the 2020 Election” determin…\n\nSee more\n\n2\n\nView all 8 replies\n\nTom Drexler\n\nFor those still unpersuaded, and in the perhaps vain hope that some of you might be open to actually knowing the truth, Trump knowingly lied throughout his speech claiming election vulnerabilities. Just one of the many instances follows: Trump resurrec…\n\nSee more\n\nCindi Marshall Fulgham\n\nI knew, anyone with any common sense would have known.\n\n4\n\nView 1 reply\n\nView more comments\n\n3 of 17","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2033.1476789997396,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}